      <div class="project-description">
        <h3>
          <a href="{{ '/projects/multi-view-interactive-world-model/' | relative_url }}">Map-Conditioned Multi-View Interactive World Modeling</a>
        </h3>
        <p class="project-meta">Peking University · Prof. Hao Tang's Group · Ongoing</p>
        <p>
          We adapt <em>LingBot-World</em>, a 14B action-conditioned video Diffusion Transformer, to highly dynamic CS:GO scenes. Our system targets
          synchronized viewpoints, a stable shared world, complex interaction, and long-horizon generation.
        </p>
        <p>
          I designed a residual Map Memory adapter with LoRA, built the synchronized multi-view data and evaluation pipeline, and trained and debugged
          distributed experiments on 16× NVIDIA H200 GPUs.
        </p>
